  data: {
    LLM: "1. Antes: All players post the ante. 2. Deal: Seven cards face down to each player. 3. First betting round: Player to dealer's left acts first. 4. Pass the trash: Each active player places three unwanted cards face down; when all are ready, each set of three is passed to the next active player to the left. 5. Second betting round. 6. Discard: Everyone discards two unwanted cards (each keeps five). 7. Arrange: Each player chooses an order for the five cards and stacks them face down. 8. Reveal and bet: Each player turns over the first card of their stack; betting round begun by the player with the highest hand showing. Repeat for second, third, and fourth cards (four cards face up, one face down). 9. Final betting round. 10. Showdown: Highest five-card hand wins the pot.",
    Player: "1. Antes: All players post the ante. 2. Deal: Seven cards face down to each player. 3. First betting round: Player to dealer's left acts first. 4. Pass the trash: Each active player places three unwanted cards face down; when all are ready, each set of three is passed to the next active player to the left. 5. Second betting round. 6. Discard: Everyone discards two unwanted cards (each keeps five). 7. Arrange: Each player chooses an order for the five cards and stacks them face down. 8. Reveal and bet: Each player turns over the first card of their stack; betting round begun by the player with the highest hand showing. Repeat for second, third, and fourth cards (four cards face up, one face down). 9. Final betting round. 10. Showdown: Highest five-card hand wins the pot.",
    objective: 'Win the pot by having the highest five-card poker hand at showdown after the pass, discard, and reveal phases.',
    gameplay: "1. Antes: All players post the ante. 2. Deal: Seven cards face down to each player. 3. First betting round: Player to dealer's left acts first. 4. Pass the trash: Each active player places three unwanted cards face down; when all are ready, each set of three is passed to the next active player to the left. 5. Second betting round. 6. Discard: Everyone discards two unwanted cards (each keeps five). 7. Arrange: Each player chooses an order for the five cards and stacks them face down. 8. Reveal and bet: Each player turns over the first card of their stack; betting round begun by the player with the highest hand showing. Repeat for second, third, and fourth cards (four cards face up, one face down). 9. Final betting round. 10. Showdown: Highest five-card hand wins the pot.",
